# Gatherly AI Configuration
# Set your AI provider and API key to enable live LLM generation.
# If left blank, Gatherly seamlessly runs in high-precision Offline Mode (Rule-based Expert Planner)
# with deterministic budget math, milestone generation, and constraint solving.

VITE_AI_PROVIDER=openai
VITE_AI_API_KEY=
VITE_AI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
VITE_AI_BASE_URL=

# Note: Disclose external data sharing to users when live AI is active.
# Never commit .env or actual keys to Git repository.
